1336
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,200
Ma tegelikult arvasin, et see oli...

1337
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,200
aga see polnud just see, mida ma olin arvasnud…

1338
00:36:11,120 --> 00:36:13,200
(hingamine on pugenud)

1339
00:36:13,240 --> 00:36:15,200
Jah, ei, ei, see oli…

1340
00:36:13,240 --> 00:36:15,200
Noh, see oli ju sinu ring.

1341
00:36:15,240 --> 00:36:17,320
aga mitte see põlv.

1342
00:36:15,240 --> 00:36:17,320
millest me räägime.

1343
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:22,040
– Ilmselt nüüd, kui see Fiat...

1344
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:22,040
on ikka sinu parkimiskoht, aga mitte see, millest me räägime.

1345
00:36:17,360 --> 00:36:22,040
-Jah.

1346
00:36:22,080 --> 00:36:24,880
Sa oled käitunud nagu...

1347
00:36:22,080 --> 00:36:24,880
...et saaksin midagi veidi paremat osta.


1348
00:36:22,080 --> 00:36:24,880
osta midagi.

1349
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:27,360
veidi rohkem...

1350
00:36:24,920 --> 00:36:27,360
Ma ei tea, tähtede all.

1351
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,120
Ei, ei, noh, jah, aga ei.

1352
00:36:27,400 --> 00:36:30,120
Ma proovisin erinevaid BMW mudeleid.

1353
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:33,200
ja siis ma otsustasin…

1354
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:33,200
"Sa tead, mis?

1355
00:36:30,160 --> 00:36:33,200
Ma kavatsen midagi suurejoonelist teha.

1356
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:36,480
Nii et ma läksin ja ostsin endale...

1357
00:36:33,240 --> 00:36:36,480
üks Bentley Continental GT.

1358
00:36:36,520 --> 00:36:39,800
Oh, see on küll.

1359
00:36:36,520 --> 00:36:39,800
See on tegelikult üsna huvitav auto.

1360
00:36:36,520 --> 00:36:39,800
Mis mudelit sul on?

1361
00:36:40,760 --> 00:36:42,480
See on lihtsalt Continental GT V8 mudel.

1362
00:36:42,520 --> 00:36:44,600
- See on õige.

1363
00:36:42,520 --> 00:36:44,600
-Jah.

1364
00:36:44,640 --> 00:36:47,440
Sest seal on nii palju miine.

1365
00:36:44,640 --> 00:36:47,440
sa saad sellel peal sõita.

1366
00:36:44,640 --> 00:36:47,440
tee peal.

1367
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:49,280
– See ei ole.

1368
00:36:47,480 --> 00:36:49,280
