1440
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:18,840
mis oli...

1441
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:22,160
(JÄRLIB GARY BARLOW'T)

1442
00:38:20,240 --> 00:38:22,160
Täiesti fantastiline, jah.

1443
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:27,680
Aga nüüd ma olen olnud

1444
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:27,680
... koos "The Stig" kull lavettima.

1445
00:38:24,280 --> 00:38:27,680
See on üsna imeline.

1446
00:38:27,720 --> 00:38:29,160
-Igatahes...

1447
00:38:27,720 --> 00:38:29,160
- Jah.

1448
00:38:29,200 --> 00:38:33,560
Võib-olla te läksite sinna välja?

1449
00:38:29,200 --> 00:38:33,560
Vauxhall Astraga?

1450
00:38:29,200 --> 00:38:33,560
Kas see on tehniline abi?

1451
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:35,560
-Jah.

1452
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:35,560
– Palju ringe, palju treeninguid?

1453
00:38:35,600 --> 00:38:39,240
Mõned, päris palju.

1454
00:38:35,600 --> 00:38:39,240
